{"overview":"علی در یک شهرستان به دنیا آمد و پدرش او را از خانواده ترد کرد. علی که مبتلا به سندرم ساوانت است در پرورشگاه بزرگ می شود، او اکنون فارغ التحصیل دانشکده پزشکی است و آرزو دارد.","tagline":"دکتر معجزه گر اقتباسی از سریال کره ای آقای دکتر و سریال آمریکایی دکتر خوب است.","overview_en":"Mucize Doktor / A Miracle (2019) is a Turkish FOX medical drama (64 episodes) starring Taner Ölmez, adapted from the Korean series Good Doctor. Ali Vefa, a young surgical resident with autism savant syndrome, joins a prestigious Istanbul hospital — facing resistance from colleagues who doubt his abilities. As he proves his genius case by case, he navigates friendships, rivalry and first love while learning what it means to belong.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":28,"y":2019,"poster":"/nNHlXL61U5OQkcfGphYtTDmyX1l.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":36,"y":2020,"poster":"/ZNxfeXYnlUGYk1cMzL7CBvUnHs.jpg"}],"episodes":64,"crew":["Aytaç Çiçek","Yusuf Pirhasan"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Taner Ölmez","role":"Dr. Ali Vefa","photo":"/QG3bNfNw5aRqEzhttSIEey4nBt.jpg"},{"name":"Onur Tuna","role":"Dr. Ferman Eryiğit","photo":"/kSxQUj9iampPna4XyuFfDvDEFcx.jpg"},{"name":"Sinem Ünsal","role":"Dr. Nazlı Gülengül","photo":"/z7LF1TP34VGJiL3bwxNHJHRCPQE.jpg"},{"name":"هازال تورسان","role":"Beliz Boysal","photo":"/i6g679VSuNgGvcEb5ioJHFDXTdf.jpg","en":"Hazal Türesan"},{"name":"Murat Aygen","role":"Dr. Tanju Korman","photo":"/52rOMVqVfaJYQX8TF3gWzKMHHDK.jpg"},{"name":"Fırat Altunmeşe","role":"Dr. Demir Aldırmaz","photo":"/8O6ieajU2tdcZdoTMDwrOaTQO5P.jpg"},{"name":"Hakan Kurtaş","role":"Dr. Doruk Öztürk","photo":"/bPqpPuQddPLqMNxbSwVYl4nc5O2.jpg"},{"name":"Hayal Köseoğlu","role":"Açelya Dingin","photo":"/6u07z4vdDb8WNlwRfD0G8y2UKpG.jpg"},{"name":"Bihter Dinçel","role":"Selvi Ustagil","photo":"/pFdFplLcUKZNyU2qZtoLCQC82BF.jpg"},{"name":"Merve Bulut","role":"Gülin Şenalp","photo":"/tJDrVTpaXPSdmi0Qj0gAD43mKwH.jpg"},{"name":"Reh